WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:10.835
Owl: Let's make something.

2
00:00:10.836 --> 00:00:38.411
Let's make something with snow. Squirrel:

3
00:00:38.412 --> 00:01:03.819
I will make a snowball. Owl:

4
00:01:03.820 --> 00:01:34.994
Hmm. I will make a bigger snowball. Squirrel:

5
00:01:34.995 --> 00:01:42.668
I can make an arm. Owl:

6
00:01:42.669 --> 00:01:54.082
I can make an arm too.

7
00:01:54.083 --> 00:02:09.071
Squirrel: I can make eyes.

8
00:02:09.072 --> 00:02:18.740
Owl: I can make a mouth.

9
00:02:18.741 --> 00:02:27.789
Squirrel: I can make a nose.

10
00:02:27.790 --> 00:02:32.469
Owl: Aha! We made something.

11
00:02:32.470 --> 00:02:44.201
Owl: We made a snowman!

12
00:02:44.202 --> 00:02:57.974
Squirrel: We make a good team!

